#### 🟢 LOW

**9. General Fixture (Over-broad Setup)** — `setUp()` / `rng` field (line 21)

The `rng` field is initialized in `@BeforeEach` but never used by any test method. Every test pays for its construction.

**Refactor:** Remove `rng` from the fixture entirely. If a future test needs randomness, inject it locally.

