| Priority | Smell | Fix | Effort |
|----------|-------|-----|--------|
| 1 | Assertion-Free Test | Add assertion | Trivial |
| 2 | Sleepy Test | Delete `Thread.sleep` | Trivial |
| 3 | Exception Handling | Replace try/catch with `assertThrows` | Low |
| 4 | Mystery Guest | Inline test data, remove filesystem I/O | Low |
| 5 | Conditional Test Logic | Flatten to explicit setup | Low |
| 6 | Eager Test | Split into focused tests | Medium |
